### BOOK SERVICE  ·  http://localhost:3000/books
###
### Reads are public at the gateway; writes need a token.
###
### NOTE: a new book is DRAFT, and GET /books serves the PUBLISHED catalogue
### only — so a book you create here will not appear in the browse list until
### something publishes it. That is deliberate, not a bug.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = amr@example.com
@password = password123


### Log in — writes below need the token
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}


### ── WRITES ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create  →  201.  Idempotency-Key is required; resend the same one to replay.
# @name createBook
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{
  "title": "Distributed Systems for Skeptics",
  "description": "A field guide to partial failure.",
  "genre": ["non-fiction", "engineering"]
}

@bookId = {{createBook.response.body.data.id}}


### Create without a token  →  401
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "title": "No token", "description": "Should not be created.", "genre": [] }


### Update — owner only  →  200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": "A field guide to partial failure. Second edition." }


### ── READS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### One book  →  200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/{{bookId}}


### ── BROWSE: filter · sort · paginate ────────────────────────────
###
### Defaults: page=1, limit=10, sort=publishedAt, order=desc.
### total is a real count up to 500; past that totalIsExact goes false and the
### pager should read "50+ pages" rather than claim a last page.

### Everything (defaults)  →  200
GET {{baseUrl}}/books


### Filter by genre — repeat the param for more than one
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?genre=fantasy&genre=engineering


### Search titles (case-insensitive, substring)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?q=distributed


### Sort + page
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?sort=title&order=asc&page=2&limit=5


### Everything at once
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?genre=engineering&q=systems&sort=title&order=asc&page=1&limit=5


### ── BROWSE: what must be refused ────────────────────────────────

### limit above the cap  →  400  ("must be <= 50")
### An unbounded limit is a free denial of service, not a typo.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?limit=51


### sort on a column that is not on the allowlist  →  400
### sort names a column, so the allowlist is the whole defence.
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?sort=ownerUserId


### page 0  →  400
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?page=0
